BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td 13 TL
(influences are working against the market price of the stock for the) Tj T*
(time being. In the course of time the market price will go up towards) Tj T*
(the real value. This matter will be more fully explained in subsequent) Tj T*
(chapters.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(You always should keep in mind the fact that when you buy a stock at a) Tj T*
(higher price than its intrinsic value, you are taking a risk. The stock) Tj T*
(may have great future possibilities, but it is risky to buy stocks when) Tj T*
(present assets and earnings do not warrant their market prices, no) Tj T*
(matter how attractive prospective future earnings may appear. However,) Tj T*
(the possibilities of profit sometimes are so great that one is justified) Tj T*
(in taking this risk.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is our belief that the majority of traders buy stocks because they) Tj T*
(are active in the market and somebody said they were a good buy, even) Tj T*
(though the real values may not be nearly as much as the market prices.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(As an example of this kind of trading, we want to call your attention to) Tj T*
(a news item that appeared in a New York paper. It stated that on April) Tj T*
(1st, some brokers in Detroit, as an April Fool joke, gave out a tip to) Tj T*
(buy A. F. P., meaning April Fool Preferred, but when asked what it) Tj T*
(meant, replied "American Fire Protection." Of course, there was no such) Tj T*
(stock, but there was active trading in it until the joke was discovered.) Tj T*
(Evidently it is not necessary to list a stock on the Detroit Stock) Tj T*
(Exchange in order to trade in it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This story may or may not be true, but we believe the statement that) Tj T*
(people trade in stocks they do not know anything about is true. You) Tj T*
(should be careful not to buy a stock merely because somebody says it is) Tj T*
(a good thing to buy, unless the person making the statement is in the) Tj T*
(business of giving information on stocks, because it may be only a rumor) Tj T*
(with no substantial basis. Of course, if many people act on the rumor,) Tj T*
(there will be active trading in the stock, and it is frequently for that) Tj T*
(purpose that such rumors are started.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
