() Tj T*
(WHAT STOCKS TO BUY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In deciding what stocks to buy, it is well to consider first the classes) Tj T*
(of stocks, and then what particular stocks you should buy in the classes) Tj T*
