(of ascertaining a definite basis upon which to predict future movements) Tj T*
(in stock prices. Several of these organizations use very different) Tj T*
(statistics upon which to base their conclusions, and yet their) Tj T*
(conclusions are very similar. They have proved beyond any question of) Tj T*
(doubt that some of these movements are clearly indicated by laws that) Tj T*
(never fail.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We do not attempt in this book to explain the fundamental statistics) Tj T*
(upon which the predictions of business cycles are based, but in the next) Tj T*
(five chapters we explain some of the influences that affect the) Tj T*
(movements in stock prices. Read these chapters very carefully, for your) Tj T*
