() Tj T*
(There are four periods to the operation of such pools. First is the) Tj T*
(period of accumulation. A number of large holders of stock in a certain) Tj T*
(company will pool their stock, all agreeing not to sell except from the) Tj T*
(pool, in which all benefit proportionately. Then they give out bad news) Tj T*
(about the company. That is very easy to do, because financial writers) Tj T*
(usually accept the news that is given to them without much) Tj T*
(investigation, especially writers on daily papers, because they have not) Tj T*
(the time to investigate. Their copy must be ready in a few hours after) Tj T*
(they get the information. See Chapter XXV. on "Market Information" for) Tj T*
(fuller explanation of the reason why financial news usually is) Tj T*
(misleading. The manipulators of stock prices can have financial news) Tj T*
("made to order.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When the general public reads this news and sees the stock going down,) Tj T*
(many of them get discouraged and sell. It is just the time they should) Tj T*
(not sell, but it is a well known fact that the majority of people do in) Tj T*
(the stock market just what they should not do. The more they sell the) Tj T*
(more the price goes down, and the pool operators accumulate the stock.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Having secured all the stock they want, they give out good news and) Tj T*
(continue to buy the stock until it starts to go up. The public reads) Tj T*
(this favorable news, and seeing the stock go up, will go into the market) Tj T*
(and buy, which puts it up higher. All the time financial writers are) Tj T*
(supplying good news about the stock and the public buys it. After they) Tj T*
(have sold all of it, the public may still be anxious for more, and the) Tj T*
(pool operators may go short of the stock. Then they will begin giving) Tj T*
(out bad news, so that they can buy in stock at a lower price to cover) Tj T*
(their short interests.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(After that they have very little interest in the market. If it is) Tj T*
(declining too fast, they may support it occasionally by buying some) Tj T*
(stock and giving out some favorable news. That will make the market) Tj T*
(rally and they will sell out the newly acquired stock near the top of) Tj T*
(the rally.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Manipulations of this kind appear to be going on nearly all the time,) Tj T*
(and there does not seem to be any limit to the number of suckers who) Tj T*
(fall for them. But then, one can't blame the public when you realize how) Tj T*
(thoroughly unreliable is most of the market information given to them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
