() Tj T*
(If you put up 20% of the purchase price of your stocks with your broker,) Tj T*
(he has to pay the other 80%, but he can do that by borrowing that amount) Tj T*
(from his bank, and putting up the stock as security. In this way brokers) Tj T*
(are able to handle all the margin business that comes to them, as long) Tj T*
(as money can be borrowed. Of course, there are some stocks that are not) Tj T*
