() Tj T*
(Many people think that buying stocks on margin is gambling and that) Tj T*
(people should not do it for that reason, but buying on margin is done in) Tj T*
(all lines of business, although it may not be known under that name. If) Tj T*
(you bought stock outright, but borrowed 80% of the purchase price from) Tj T*
(your banker to complete your payment for it and put up the stock with) Tj T*
(him as security, you would be buying on margin just the same.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
