(put them away in a safe deposit box. However, when stocks are low the) Tj T*
(risk in buying on a liberal margin is very small, and the possibilities) Tj T*
(of profit are so much greater, we do not see any objection to taking) Tj T*
(advantage of this method of trading.) Tj T*
