(    room. So I had an exceptional opportunity to size up the stock) Tj T*
(    business. The chief duties of the manager are to meet customers when) Tj T*
(    they visit the office, tell them how the market is acting, the) Tj T*
(    latest news from the news-tickers and the gossip of the Street. But) Tj T*
(    the real duties are to get business for the house. Once a most) Tj T*
