(    he knew our Milwaukee House and would like to open an account. Of) Tj T*
(    course, we were all smiles, for here was a new 'customer.') Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    "One day while in Boston he called us up on the long-distance) Tj T*
(    telephone to make an inquiry about the grain market. One of my) Tj T*
