(    Harvard Economic Service.) Tj T*
(    Poor's Investment Service.) Tj T*
(    Moody's Investors Service.) Tj T*
(    Richard D. Wyckoff Analytical Staff._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The above are the principal organizations of this kind. Subscriptions to) Tj T*
(their service cost from $85 to $1000 a year. In addition to these there) Tj T*
(are a few other organizations besides our own and individuals giving a) Tj T*
(somewhat similar service, but we know of none that gives such a service) Tj T*
(at as low a price as ours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(You should not confuse the service given by the above organizations with) Tj T*
(that given by many organizations and individuals who attempt to tell you) Tj T*
(what the market is going to do from day to day. In other words, they) Tj T*
(give 'tips' on the market. There are a number who issue daily market) Tj T*
(letters of this kind and charge from $10 to $25 a month for their) Tj T*
(service, but it is a line of service that we do not recommend at all,) Tj T*
(because we consider that you would be taking a very great risk if you) Tj T*
(followed advice of that kind. You might make enormously large profits) Tj T*
(occasionally, but you would also have frequent losses, and when the) Tj T*
(losses did come they might be greater than all the previous profits. We) Tj T*
(want you to understand that that kind of advice is entirely different) Tj T*
(from what we are recommending.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CHAPTER XXVI.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SUCCESSFUL SPECULATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Success in stock speculation depends upon a few things that are very) Tj T*
(simple.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If you know what to buy, when to buy, and when to sell, and will act in) Tj T*
(accordance with that knowledge, your success is assured. You may think) Tj T*
(it is impossible to know these things, but it is not so difficult as it) Tj T*
(is supposed to be.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many people buy stocks at the wrong time, and most of those who do buy) Tj T*
(them at the right time, buy the wrong stocks. Right now \(early in April,) Tj T*
(1922\) is buying time in the stock market, and it is possible that this) Tj T*
(buying time may continue--with some interruptions--for another year or) Tj T*
(two, or even longer.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
